      "Language": "dan",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 46-year-old woman presented with classic symptoms. Computed tomography-angiography and duplex ultrasonography showed stenosis of the aa. mesenteria superior et inferior. The patient was moved to a university hospital and a percutaneous transluminal angioplasty with insertion of stents was performed. She was discharged shortly after feeling well."},
